  "limits": [
    "UNPRINTED PROTOTYPE. No physical print, fit, pinch, tip, drawer-ejection, or caster-brake test was run.",
    "Not a finished print kit and not a child-safe toy. Hinge pinch, tipping, a drawer coming free, and wheel locks are unproven.",
    "Clearances in this manifest are CAD design allowances.",
    "The CAD generator did not run a slicer. A later independent audit used generic PrusaSlicer 2.7.4, 0.4 mm nozzle, 0.12 mm layers, PLA. Hinge coupon A and the drawer rail coupon had no support islands. The hearth ground storey in the supplied pose needed 865 support islands and an estimate of about 50 hours. That slice is not an H3C profile and not a real print. Counts and times are illustrative and configuration-dependent. Orientation and part separation need further development. Bases and drawers are supplied on edge; that pose was not validated. A 0.6 mm or 0.8 mm nozzle was not tested.",
    "Visual design is an initial simplified original prototype. References inspire features. This is not a finished replica.",
    "Metal rod, spring pin, casters, and screws are catalog assumptions. They are not in the plastic zip.",
    "The 5 V lighting is an empty groove and a rear slack pocket. No wire, LED, or supply is specified as a tested circuit.",
    "0.4 mm nozzle basis. A 0.2 mm nozzle is not confirmed.",
    "Story joints are rectangular keys. There are no magnets.",
    "Queen Anne is a different model and is not changed by this one."
  ]
}